damaged_code:
```rust
// Thread 1 - Publisher
unsafe {
    PAYLOAD = 42; // Plain store
}
READY.store(true, Ordering::Relaxed); // BUG! Relaxed store

// Thread 2 - Consumer
if READY.load(Ordering::Relaxed) {
    // Compiler/CPU could reorder PAYLOAD read before READY load,
    // or READY store before PAYLOAD store!
    println!("{}", unsafe { PAYLOAD }); 
}
```

fix:
Use `Acquire` and `Release` ordering.
```rust
// Thread 1
unsafe { PAYLOAD = 42; }
READY.store(true, Ordering::Release);

// Thread 2
if READY.load(Ordering::Acquire) {
    println!("{}", unsafe { PAYLOAD });
}
```
